MODULE: RefusalSourceAttributedDropsWriterSource
TARGET: RefusalSourceAttributed
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a writer saturation refusal loses its source
PERTURBS: ReReadAfterExpiry

--- FIND
        !.source = IF consumer.expiry = 2 /\ GateValue = 2 THEN "WalAdmission" ELSE "None"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: lose refusal-source attribution.
        !.source = "None"]
--- END
